          ],
          "text": "A 9-year-old female was admitted with a 2-week history of polyuria, polydipsia, and weight loss, with 2 days of vomiting, abdominal pain, and drowsiness, with a diagnosis of diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) on a background of new-onset type 1 diabetes mellitus.",
